  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seconded National Expert - EUD KIEV DG NEAR Coordination Ukraine. Main purpose of the secondment is to strengthen donor coordination in close cooperation with the Government of Ukraine, the Heads of Cooperation and EU Cooperation Counsellor groups, and the Ukraine Donor Platform Secretariat based in Brussels.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekunderad Nationell Expert - EUD Kiev DG NEAR Givarkoordinering Ukraina. Huvudm&#xe5;let med sekunderingen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka givarsamordningen i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med Ukrainas regering, EU:s samarbetsr&#xe5;dsgrupper samt sekretariatet f&#xf6;r den ukrainska givarplattformen i Bryssel.</narrative>
